<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Erro 500 - Algo deu errado</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; text-align: center; }
    .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 24px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
    h1 { color: #d9534f; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #555; }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }
    .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 12px 18px; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; }
    .download-btn { background: #3368a0; }
    .whatsapp-btn { background: #25d366; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Ops! Algo deu errado.</h1>
    <p>Ocorreu um erro inesperado no sistema. Baixe o relatório técnico ou entre em contato para que possamos resolver.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button download-btn" href="<%= error_log_path(report_id) %>">Baixar log do erro</a>
      <a class="button whatsapp-btn" href="https://wa.me/554999786513?text=Olá,%20encontrei%20um%20erro%20no%20workstation." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Falar no WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
